},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Princess of the country of Solide. She is in a position to temporarily rule the country on behalf of her detained father."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she is proud of her father as a king who won the war and developed the country, he accepts it as a teacher when it comes to taking forcible measures for the prosperity of the nation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She tries to act as a dignified knight, and her sword skills, which she has been training since she was a child, is one of the best in the country."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84558"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソリデ国の姫。療養中の父に代わって一時的に国を治める立場となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦争に勝利し、国を発展させた国王としての父を誇りに思う反面、国家繁栄のためなら強引な手段を取る面に関しては反面教師として受け止めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凛々しい騎士として振舞うことを心掛けており、幼少の頃から訓練を続けてきた剣技は国内でも随一の腕となっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21697","sourceWorkId":"27902","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソリデ国の姫。監禁された父に代わって一時的に国を治める立場となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦争に勝利し、国を発展させた国王としての父を誇りに思う反面、国家繁栄のためなら強引な手段を取る面に関しては反面教師として受け止めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凛々しい騎士として振舞うことを心掛けており、幼少の頃から訓練を続けてきた剣技は国内でも随一の腕となっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"70352"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c9564b1933dbc3bfc963248288568a4fa07f801b6a2f408a91a63b513e0f756.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c51dc55d9d4e707d5801e1ba1062e0b09b6d026c35015bb6fc5d501639052177.webp","width":172,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23","name":"民安 ともえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:281191:70352:5900:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c84559"